sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Buy tickets
    %% Stories: 12, 14, 15, 16, 17, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26
    %% Description: From the event page a visitor picks ticket types and seats on the venue map, puts several tickets in the cart, checks out as a user or as a guest, and pays.
    actor VI as Visitor
    participant EV as Event
    participant VE as Venue
    participant TI as Ticket
    participant ORD as Order
    participant U as User
    participant PA as Payment

    VI->>EV: buy tickets on the event page [12]
    EV->>TI: getAvailableTickets()
    EV->>VE: getSeatMap()
    EV-->>VI: ticket types and free seats on the venue map [21, 22, 23]
    VI->>ORD: add tickets for several people to the cart [20, 24]
    ORD->>TI: reserve()
    alt logged-in user
        ORD->>U: getSavedDetails()
    else guest checkout [14, 15, 16, 17]
        VI->>ORD: enter name and email only
    end
    ORD-->>VI: order summary [25]
    ORD->>PA: getPaymentMethods()
    PA-->>VI: payment methods [26]
    VI->>PA: pay with the chosen method
    PA->>ORD: confirm()
    ORD->>TI: markSold()
